# armour/shared/pauldron_crystal4_r: the large CRYSTAL pauldron on the right shoulder (crystal.4; FORGE-SHOULDERS, STYLE_P2 28.3).
# a cluster of narrow crystal points standing out of a slim band, the tallest 2 px over the shoulder, dark gaps
# between them (STARFALL, starmetal); vertical and light.
# Rides the lean and the bob and lifts a pixel on wind-ups (`up`). Finish regions: R the band at the foot, G the tallest point's glint, N the gaps between points, P the points.
# Shared by the man and the woman (D10). Generated by FORGE-SHOULDERS gen.py from shapes.py (re-run, never hand-edit
# the derived views). Format: rpg/art/doll/doll.h.
# The rest views repeat as `when shoulder-crystal` overlays: the shape's own drawing, which the body's cut skips.
use person
role pauldron crystal.4
layer armNear
anchor shoulderR
keys pauld
z 5
side R

